# GAMEPLAY-PROOF: Play-mode cards, one editor session in Projects/Desert.
# Cards: GP2 (walk / jump / crouch through IA_Move / IA_Jump / IA_Crouch, the camera on its boom), GP1 (one Input
# Action driven by its second mapped key), GP3 (death -> respawn), GP4 (button opens a door), GAME-2B (menu hover / focus).
# Keys from IMC_Default.deinputcontext: W/A/S/D move, Space jump, C and LeftControl crouch.
# GP3 / GP4: no scene in Projects/Desert carries a kill volume / respawn or ButtonOpensDoor.lua (Scripts/Examples has
# the script, no scene uses it) - their lines stay here as the spec and are reported blocked in REMAINDER-SHOTS-SCN.
# GP1's remap (a runtime rebind, UE EnhancedInputUserSettings) has no editor or script entry yet; the frame below
# proves the mapping context's second key for the same action - the rebind half is reported blocked.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/PlayerController_Demo.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 1
Тогда-вид gp2_idle GP2: the player stands on the ground, the camera behind and above it on the boom (SpringArm), Idle pose
Когда input keydown - - W
Когда advance 1
Тогда-вид gp2_walk GP2: W held 1 s - the player moved forward (the floor slid under the camera), Walk/Run pose, the camera followed at the boom length
Когда input keyup - - W
Когда input keydown - - Space
Когда advance 0.3
Тогда-вид gp2_jump GP2: Space - the player in the air (feet above the floor), Jump pose
Когда input keyup - - Space
Когда advance 1.5
Когда input keydown - - C
Когда advance 0.5
Тогда-вид gp2_crouch GP2: C held - the player crouched (capsule and camera lower than gp2_idle)
Когда input keyup - - C
Когда advance 0.5
Когда input keydown - - LeftControl
Когда advance 0.5
Тогда-вид gp1_second_key GP1: LeftControl (IA_Crouch's second mapped key) crouches exactly as C did in gp2_crouch
Когда input keyup - - LeftControl
Когда run Action "Stop"
Когда run Scene "Open Scene MainMenu.desce"
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 0.5
Тогда-вид game2b_menu GAME-2B: the main menu drawn in the Play view, no button highlighted
Когда input key - - Down
Когда advance 0.2
Тогда-вид game2b_focus GAME-2B: keyboard focus - one button carries the focus style (outline / highlight), moved by Down
Когда input move - 640,400
Когда advance 0.2
Тогда-вид game2b_hover GAME-2B: the pointer over a button - that button in its hover style
Когда run Action "Stop"
Тогда gp_stop Play stopped; editor.log 0 script errors
